<h3>Step 1: Install PocketOne and create an app.</h3>
<p>On macOS or Linux, with <a href="https://brew.sh">Homebrew</a>:</p>
<pre><code class="language-bash">brew install pockethost/tap/pocketone
pocketone pages create myapp</code></pre>
<p>On Windows, with <a href="https://scoop.sh">Scoop</a> (or see <a href="/docs/windows">Install on Windows</a>):</p>
<pre><code class="language-powershell">scoop bucket add pockethost https://github.com/pockethost/scoop-bucket
scoop install pocketone
pocketone pages create myapp</code></pre>

<h3>Step 2: Run.</h3>
<pre><code class="language-bash">cd myapp
pocketone superuser upsert you@example.com &lt;password&gt; --dir ./pb_data
pocketone serve --dir ./pb_data --dev
</code></pre>
